ssion along with the large load tariff by midyear.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/oge-energy-oge-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OGE 2025 Q4","e":"oge","d":"2026-02-18","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Aditya Gandhi","x":"And then maybe can you just speak to some customer protections that you are building into that large load tariff framework?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/oge-energy-oge-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OGE 2026 Q1","e":"oge","d":"2026-04-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Whitney Mutalemwa","x":"Since the last update, HB 2992 has moved further along in Oklahoma and now it explicitly requires separate large load tariffs and cost causation protections.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/oge-oge-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OGE 2026 Q1","e":"oge","d":"2026-04-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael Brown","x":"My first question is, since you haven't filed the large tariff yet, can you discuss what you're looking for in this tariff?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/oge-oge-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OGE 2026 Q1","e":"oge","d":"2026-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Charles Walworth","x":"So in terms of short term, we maintain our guidance for the year at 4% to 6%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/oge-oge-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,4201,0,0,0,3417,480],[36,1,5721,0,0,0,4356,867],[37,1,3708,0,0,0,2854,534],[38,1,4268,0,0,0,2925,1005],[39,1,3969,0,0,0,3256,364],[40,1,3490,0,0,0,3107,160],[41,1,3732,0,0,0,3170,314],[44,1,5175,0,0,0,4373,563],[45,1,4358,0,0,0,3733,426],[46,1,3804,0,0,0,3548,63],[47,1,4910,0,0,0,3972,659],[59,1,4440,0,0,0,1410,2743],[62,1,3048,0,0,0,2843,47],[63,1,4175,0,0,0,3412,471],[64,1,4725,0,0,0,3469,837],[65,1,4502,0,0,0,2573,1697],[67,1,4335,0,0,0,1754,2048]],"cin